Z||000000||LoW_KeY||11-07-2001||03:37 AM||||Ok I wasn't enjoying the bass in my fiero..<P>I went out got an 8 sounded good got stolen, ok so now I went out got a 10 but the darn box just takes up room and sure it fits behind the drivers seat, but it's one tight fit!!<P>I'm curious how many have built a box combining it somewhat with the firewall and does it sound good? <P>also i see people putting them under the passenger part by the floor but how big is the box? anyone care to show pics of the final product I crave bass and behind the seat isn't that great its muffled and getting a massage while you drive is gettin' old  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/kc.jpg"> ||||reg||6
