Z||000002||Fierowrecker||11-07-2001||08:10 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LoW_KeY:<BR><B>Ok I wasn't enjoying the bass in my fiero..<P>I went out got an 8 sounded good got stolen, ok so now I went out got a 10 but the darn box just takes up room and sure it fits behind the drivers seat, but it's one tight fit!!<P>I'm curious how many have built a box combining it somewhat with the firewall and does it sound good? <P>also i see people putting them under the passenger part by the floor but how big is the box? anyone care to show pics of the final product I crave bass and behind the seat isn't that great its muffled and getting a massage while you drive is gettin' old   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey Low!<BR>Another Michigander!<BR>I have an 8" located in the pass foot well...<BR>I use a pvc tube for an enclosure, half is exposed, the other half is up in the dash area...<BR>Eliminates the dead pedal, but still room for feet...<BR><P>------------------<BR>crash... The Fierowrecker<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/uploads/crash_sig.jpg">        <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||1
