Z||000004||LoW_KeY||11-07-2001||10:33 AM||||Hey 86se,<P>Just curious do you have the dimensions for the box and all? if I can get the dimensions I'd really love to put the 10 on the passenger side.<P>I should take a picture and show you what it looks like if I do set it over there its rediculous.<P>Oh yeah another michigander because MI rocks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I love what that fierosound guy did, but that looks like it took some time and I just get parnoid about doing any cutting on the firewall/decklid for sound/scoops.<P>||||reg||12
Z||000005||stimpy||11-07-2001||07:02 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LoW_KeY:<BR><B>I see people putting them under the passenger part by the floor but how big is the box? Anyone care to show pics of the final product? <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P> <IMG SRC="http://pip.pennock.nl/uploads/pffinterior.jpg"> <P>As you can see, the box takes no more room out of the passengeers side then the pedals take out of the drivers side. I've never had a complaint about the box taking up too much room. My box is tuned to be kinda boomy, sounds best with urban type music. Tighter bass would need smaller air volume inside, I suppose? Help me out, box makers!||||reg||1
