Z||000008||Monkeyman||11-11-2001||01:22 PM||||I had one of <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>AusFieros sub boxes</A>.  It's designed for a 10" sub and it sounded great.  It stuck out a little more that I liked, but I could still shift just fine (4 spd).  I think Aus is going to start making them again soon.  I only sold mine because I'm making a custom console and it didn't fit.<p>[This message has been edited by Monkeyman (edited 11-11-2001).]||||reg||1
